WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:07.710
(Niko) Hi everyone, we have some exciting news. (Sam) Over the last 12 months, it's gotten incredibly busy here. We are shooting,

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:11.099
we are editing we're doing tons of stuff. (Niko) We're making more videos than we ever have before,

00:00:11.099 --> 00:00:13.589
