00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:33.509
Well, it's really simple. Basically, in the description,

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:40.590
We have included a link to a bunch of clips from an unreleased video and we want you to edit them with your

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:47.219
style. Once you've done that, send us a link to that video, following our very strict formatting instructions.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:51.090
(Jake) Format it this way: in the subject line, put "Corridor Job Application"

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:58.289
followed by vertical line followed by your name, and then in the body of the e-mail, put your name again with an unlisted YouTube link,

00:00:58.570 --> 00:01:01.529
and that's it. (Sam) When all the emails will look the same,

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:06.419
all we're gonna do is just judge you by how good your video is. (Jake) Please format and send this email correctly.

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:11.909
We're gonna get hundreds and hundreds of these emails. If you guys don't format the e-mail correctly, it's real simple...

00:01:12.369 --> 00:01:17.489
I'm probably not gonna watch the video because you didn't format the e-mail correctly, and... (Sam) One small note!

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:21.629
You might not be aware of this but our studio is currently located in Los Angeles, California.

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:25.769
(Niko) Oh, that's an important one. (Sam) So, if you do happen to be selected as an applicant,

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:32.040
you might have to move here. (Jake) Applications will end at the end of day on March 15th, Pacific Time.

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:36.869
I'll be looking for all of your beautifully formatted e-mails with your incredible edits.

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:41.040
We will announce when we have found somebody.

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:47.250
Follow us on Twitter or Instagram, or obviously on the channels, and we'll do updates as we- as we move through the process.

00:01:47.649 --> 00:01:52.619
(Niko) Thank you for listening to our video, and if you are considering applying, thank you for putting in the time for the application.

00:01:52.649 --> 00:01:56.489
I know editing can be a lot of work. We are flattered with every single application that comes in.

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:58.490
It means a lot to us, honestly.

